'''Nyalladin''' (ニャラジン, Nyarajin, Nyalladin) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Doll Cats Awake!]]. He was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nyalladin
|image = E 233.png
|appearance = [[Doll Cats Awake!]]
|money drop = 1,600¢ - 6,320¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy, unlike other Awakened enemies, has quite low health compared to them. However, it has a fast attack that deals a decent amount of damage and creates a level 1 [[Wave Attack]], meaning that [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and similar units will get hit by it.

==Strategy==
Take into consideration its Floating attribute and use units like [[Fortune Teller Cat (Rare Cat)|Doctor Cat]], [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necromancer/Necro-Dancer Cat]] and [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]]. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is also very effective against this unit, due to it being both anti-floating and having the ability to block [[Wave Attack]]s.

